  "display_title": "I Wish I Could Have Two Beds",
  "description": "Their Royal Majesties Julia and Endymion married as children and grew up together as the best of friends. As their coming-of-age ceremony approaches, Julia begins searching for a concubine for her husband, oblivious to his feelings for her. Sharing the same bed these days is a bit awkward, and Julia has enough to process. She couldn’t possibly feel that way about her husband... could she? A jaded ex, shifting alliances, and magic aren’t helping matters either!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
